  worldId: 
  formalisation: A closed switch is a 1, an open one a 0. Series conducts only if
    every switch is closed (AND); parallel conducts if any switch is closed (OR).
    Computation is a shape made of switches.
  capability: Wire two switches in series or in parallel and predict which one just
    became an AND and which became an OR.
